  "description": "Click here and download the Japanese Huge Collection Plus BONUSES! graphic · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Hello and welcome!\nIt’s finally here, a product of weeks and weeks of hard work and occasional sleepless nights, but it was totally worth it! May I present a watercolour illustrations collection inspired by oriental beauty and very unique style of Japan. This collection is big, I tried to think of different elements that could be combined together to serve a variety of purposes, from business and personal branding to lines of stationery, logo design and wall art. Here you’ll find hand painted individual watercolour illustrations, pre-made compositions and cards, some abstract touch and many many more, all themed in subtle cherry blossom pinks, rich scarlet red, fresh greens and loads of gold!\nThere are also seamless patterns for you surface design, stationery sets, diaries, planners, textiles, fabrics and many other projects; and of course, their transparent background versions so you could drop any colour of your choice behind.\nThere are also some bonuses! I’ve added blank textured cards which you can drop your designs on for the authentic painterly look; there is also a cute collection of Japanese themed line elements in black ink, gold and silver – perfect for logos! And finally – and unexpected bonus I never even planned – some nice words in English but painted in the style of Japanese calligraphy – a perfect addition to your Oriental Nippon Art!\nYou’ll find many of the classic Japanese style elements here: Buddha temples, cherry blossoms (sakura), Japanese crane, swallowtails, koi fish, lotus flower, bamboo, and even a lion dog, a fan and a Fujiyama.\nThanks for stopping by friends, and hope you enjoy the collection!\n\nProduct details:\n\n-43 individual watercolour illustrations (PNG)\n-37 individual abstract watercolour and gold elements (PNG)\n-10 pre-made watercolour compositions (PNG)\n-10 pre-made abstract compositions (PNG)\n-10 pre-made posters / cards (A4, CMYK, JPEG)\n-9 unique seamless patterns (JPEG)\n-9 unique pattern repeats with transparent background (PNG)\n-BONUS 1: 5 paper and wood textured blank cards (JPEG)\n-BONUS 2: 10 line elements in black ink (PNG, AI, EPS, SVG) + 10 line elements in gold (PNG) + 10 elements in silver (PNG)\n-BONUS 3: 11 words in Japanese calligraphy style (PNG, AI, EPS)\n-all files are high resolution (300 dpi)\n-Download files will be watermarks free\n\nAll images are coloured and ready to use. Colours on your screen may be slightly different from the actual print. If you would like to change image size of this design, have any questions or special requests, please contact me.",
